{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55442","headline":"古镜歌三首 二 · 泰钦","name":"古镜歌三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁云古镜无样度，古人出入何门户？\n门户君看不见时，即此爲君全显露。\n全显露（《大正藏》本无此三字），与汝一生终保护。\n若遇知音请益来，逢人不得轻分付。\n但任作见面，不须生怕怖，看取当时演若多，直至如今成错悮。\n如今不省影分明，还是当时同一顾。\n同一顾，苦苦苦！。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"泰钦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55442.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55442","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}